<title>HUNGARY: Hungary May PPI up 19.1 pct yr/yr, 0.7 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Hungary May PPI up 19.1 pct yr/yr, 0.7 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial producer price index (PPI) showed a 19.1 percent year-on-year rise in May, and a 0.7 percent increase from April according to preliminary figures, the Central Statistical Office said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
